#: ../../library/omv.image.Statistics.rst:4
msgid "class Statistics -- Statistics Object"
msgstr "class Statistics -- Statistics 对象"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Statistics.rst:6
msgid ""
"The statistics object is an `attrtuple "
"<https://docs.micropython.org/en/latest/library/collections.html#collections.namedtuple>`_"
" returned by `histogram.get_statistics()` (and its aliases "
"`histogram.get_stats()` / `histogram.statistics()`) or directly by "
"`Image.get_statistics()`. It summarises the bin distribution of the "
"underlying :class:`Histogram <histogram>` with eight reductions per channel:"
" mean, median, mode, standard deviation, min, max, lower quartile, and upper"
" quartile."
msgstr ""
"statistics 对象是由 `histogram.get_statistics()`\\ （及其别名 `histogram.get_stats()`"
" / `histogram.statistics()`\\ ）返回，或直接由 `Image.get_statistics()` 返回的 "
"`attrtuple "
"<https://docs.micropython.org/en/latest/library/collections.html#collections.namedtuple>`_\\"
" 。它用每个通道八种归约值来总结底层 :class:`Histogram <histogram>` 的 bin "
"分布：均值、中位数、众数、标准差、最小值、最大值、下四分位数和上四分位数。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Statistics.rst:14
msgid ""
"For grayscale data, only the un-prefixed fields (``mean``, ``median``, "
"``mode``, ``stdev``, ``min``, ``max``, ``lq``, ``uq``) carry useful values "
"and they are reused as the LAB ``L`` channel reductions for RGB565 data -- "
"the ``l_*`` fields therefore mirror the un-prefixed fields and are provided "
"for symmetry. ``a_*`` and ``b_*`` only carry useful values for RGB565 "
"histograms."
msgstr ""
"对于灰度数据，只有无前缀的字段（\\ ``mean``\\ 、\\ ``median``\\ 、\\ ``mode``\\ 、\\ "
"``stdev``\\ 、\\ ``min``\\ 、\\ ``max``\\ 、\\ ``lq``\\ 、\\ ``uq``\\ "
"）才携带有用的值；对于 RGB565 数据，它们被复用为 LAB ``L`` 通道的归约值 —— 因此 ``l_*`` "
"字段镜像无前缀字段，提供它们是为了对称。\\ ``a_*`` 和 ``b_*`` 仅对 RGB565 直方图携带有用的值。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Statistics.rst:21
msgid ""
"Fields are accessible by attribute name (``statistics.mean``) or by index "
"(``statistics[0]``). The object has no public constructor."
msgstr ""
"字段可通过属性名（\\ ``statistics.mean``\\ ）或索引（\\ ``statistics[0]``\\ "
"）访问。该对象没有公开的构造函数。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Statistics.rst:26
msgid ""
"Please call `histogram.get_statistics()` or `Image.get_statistics()` to "
"create this object."
msgstr "请调用 `histogram.get_statistics()` 或 `Image.get_statistics()` 来创建该对象。"

